I eat the entire sweet cake.
I drink the last drop of tea.
The food here is very tasty.
Now my meal is finished.
I look at the young waiter.
I signal to him.
I say, "Brother, please listen."
The waiter comes to my table.
He asks, "Madam, is anything else needed?"
I say, "No, thank you."
"I am going now."
"Please give the bill."
He says, "Yes madam, I am bringing it."
He goes to the main counter.
Very soon he returns.
He brings the bill.
He places it on the table.
I look at the bill.
I say thank you to him again.
